# ============================================================
# TARGET-2050.2110 — INFINITY UNIFIED OPERATING FABRIC
# ============================================================
# This layer consolidates the roadmap into one durable control fabric.
# It does not pretend that unavailable third-party accounts, browsers,
# devices, or model inference are magically present. Those capabilities are
# represented explicitly as READY / CONNECT / UNAVAILABLE.
#
# Design invariants:
#   - no arbitrary code execution
#   - no secret values stored in mission/chat records
#   - consequential external side effects require scoped authority
#   - uncertain external side effects are never automatically replayed
#   - every important result gets provenance/integrity metadata
#   - model/provider failures degrade to deterministic built-ins
#   - user data is partitioned by user_id
# ============================================================

