# end-to-end operating loop. It deliberately reuses the preserved 2300/2275/
# 2160/2110 kernels instead of replacing them.
#
# 30 major capabilities are made executable through one durable mission fabric:
# - 15 completion points carried forward from 2300
# - 15 deeper structural capabilities derived from those points
# - one unified "start" path that can execute every safe capability immediately
#
# Truth boundaries remain explicit: no fabricated customers, money, accounts,
# device state, browser state, model results, or external side effects.
# ============================================================================

